# Line endings (#202): bash scripts, Gradle's Unix wrapper and Python stay LF in every checkout,
# also in a clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true (WSL, Git Bash and the windows-2025 CI job run
# them with bash, which fails on "\r"). Everything else keeps what is committed.
*.sh    text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
